{"v":4,"catch":"可以選擇本地多人遊戲模式（最多 4 名玩家），也可以選擇單人故事模式（由 10 個角色組成，角色靈感源自漫畫書《LASTMAN》）。","desc":"LASTFIGHT 正在將 2v2 3D 格鬥帶回您的客廳！\n\n在 8 個階段之一中撿起任何可用的物品，給你的對手一個教訓！\n\nLASTFIGHT 是一款適合在沙發上與朋友一起玩的完美遊戲。每個等級都有特定的獎勵和可以向對手投擲的物體。您能抵抗住 ANITRANS 的誘惑並取得勝利嗎？","publisher":"Joindots","release":"2024-08-22","genres":["街機","格鬥","動作","運動"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","葡萄牙文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.6GB / Switch 1.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b8eb74716379483f050797f456653785d89bc90f3ad432b746e3ea34374c2d22.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e4efc645ec33df241e40e192886533c1ef7adbbd2e78285df8e8b59049095ca6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac2f5ada7641d2a4ba1d20600761b429b8b981e8b3869539cc8c9840ebb751ab.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5c4c8aef7dbb979b7d91ba75b87c1c1b78cff08ffe6d82555d72f03ba0e4686b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/989d5a47a6f4934d7d97495106a22ee673c7844b19c227c92d905107d58e0b7c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/38042b89cba8e33f70ac5472ca7b53dc0f637f98026a83444bd3bf418efdc504.jpg"],"titleId":"01009e100bdd6000","dlc":[]}